			<p>To change the air intake, press the desired control icon.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e02099">
			<title>Recirculated air intake</title>
			<p>Air from the vehicle cabin is drawn through the heating system and cooled or heated accordingly.</p>
		</section>
		<section id="e02100">
			<title>External air intake</title>
			<p>Air enters the vehicle from outside and is heated or cooled accordingly.</p>
		</section>
